  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"With Ghosting" in the title is in larger, handwritten-like black ink contrasting with smaller, printed text throughout.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Text and watercolors by the artist of Livorno's Bagno prison plan from the Archivo di Stato di Firenze, a model ship from the Palazzo Poggi Museum in Bologna and an Egyptian ceramic basin from Museo Nazionale di San Matteo in Pisa rendered through sublimation on recycled sails, flotation devices sewn inside by the artist."--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Volume shaped as a right trapezoid, echoing both the shape of a sail and the floor plan depicted on the upper cover.</subfield>
